# Coverage OUTPUT only. Never a bare `coverage/` — the samples mirror the
# site's URL structure, so `<runtime>/src/coverage/<slug>/` is a directory
# of articles about coverage and very much belongs in the repository.
/typescript/coverage/
/vitest/coverage/
/angular/coverage/
/python/htmlcov/
/python/.coverage
/dotnet/coverage/
/java/build/reports/
/browser/coverage/

